/E (10\) Requiring lifters to enter and exit the platform respectfully promotes sportsmanship and professionalism, reinforces the values of fair play, and supports a positive public image of powerlifting. Discarding equipment, i.e. throwing belt or engaging in disrespectful conduct is not permitted, as it detracts from the professional presentation of the sport. Reasonable celebrations is permitted, provided it does not compromise safety, order, or decorum on the platform. )
